    <h1>GTA 6 Controls &amp; <em>Accessibility</em> Options</h1>
    <p class="gta-lede"><b>Heads up: I haven't played GTA 6.</b> Everything here comes from Rockstar's own support page and the outlets linked in each section, not from my time with the game. No spoilers.</p>
    <p class="small gta-asof">Last updated {UPDATED_TEXT}. Rockstar's accessibility article was last updated Nov 23, 2026.</p>
